body:
navigator.userAgentData shows as chromium and not as chrome as spoofed browser is attempting to be.

```
{
    "brands": [
        {
            "brand": "Chromium",
            "version": "141"
        },
        {
            "brand": "Not?A_Brand",
            "version": "8"
        }
    ],
    "mobile": false,
    "platform": "Windows"
}
```



Should be:


```
{
    "brands": [
        {
            "brand": "Google Chrome",
            "version": "141"
        },
        {
            "brand": "Not?A_Brand",
            "version": "8"
        },
        {
            "brand": "Chromium",
            "version": "141"
        }
    ],
    "mobile": false,
    "platform": "Windows"
}
```

**误删恢复**，原issue找不到，无法恢复。

